107
00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.980
O teste:

108
00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:14.160
metade dos chamados com a resposta nova,

109
00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.320
metade

110
00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.680
